      "content": "that oxidation and the irregular expansion makes sense. but i'm also seeing some weird noise or vibration patterns under heavy load that don't quite line up with the thermal data. it's almost like there's some chaotic element messing with the stability of the interface. how would you characterize that kind of mechanical instability? is it just a result of the material properties or is there something else that can cause it to feel sabotaged?",
